OL,3,GNEWSAFears for mature Scots Pines
OL,4,Aburned by huge Highland wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMature Scots Pine trees may be lost
OL,7,Ffrom a Highland landscape hit by a huge
OL,8,Fsummer wildfire, experts fear.
OL,10,FForestry and Land Scotland say the
OL,11,Fblaze around Glenmore in the Cairngorms
OL,12,Fmay have led to the loss of many
OL,13,Fso-called "granny pines" which have
OL,14,Fmatured over centuries.
OL,16,FThey say their loss removes important
OL,17,Fseed sources and makes it more
OL,18,Fdifficult for the species to
OL,19,Fregenerate.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
