OL,3,GNEWSAFears for mature Scots Pines
OL,4,Aburned by huge Highland wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the Scottish government agency
OL,7,Fsaid there were many encouraging signs
OL,8,Fof natural recovery among other species
OL,9,Ffollowing the fire.
